WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:15.470
watched the head roll across the floor.

2
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.352
Luckily, it was only a wooden head from a wooden body.

3
00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:22.853
"Where are we?"

4
00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:24.534
he asked loudly.

5
00:00:24.554 --> 00:00:29.016
"Keep your voice down, Vinnie," said Helene.

6
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:35.003
Helene peeked out to see if the guards were still following them.

7
00:00:36.284 --> 00:00:38.745
Vinnie and Mandy walked around the room.

8
00:00:39.686 --> 00:00:41.007
It was full of wigs.

9
00:00:41.027 --> 00:00:46.150
"Hey, look," said Mandy, as she tried one on.

10
00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:50.173
The white wig was huge, with lots of curls.

11
00:00:50.193 --> 00:00:52.194
"It's very heavy!"

12
00:00:52.214 --> 00:00:55.296
"Look at me!"

13
00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:58.258
cried Vinnie, trying one on too.

14
00:00:58.278 --> 00:01:01.833
"Shush, Vinnie," said Helene.

15
00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.775
"Why does everyone wear wigs?"

16
00:01:05.515 --> 00:01:06.236
asked Mandy.

17
00:01:06.256 --> 00:01:09.058
"It's the fashion.

18
00:01:09.438 --> 00:01:12.740
And King Louis sets the fashion," said Helene.

19
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.202
"He changes his clothes many times a day.

20
00:01:16.783 --> 00:01:18.824
What he likes, everyone wears."

21
00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:23.747
"People change their clothes when the king does?"

22
00:01:24.528 --> 00:01:25.248
asked Mandy.

23
00:01:25.268 --> 00:01:28.270
"Of course," said Helene.

24
00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.312
"I think it's safe to go now."

25
00:01:32.548 --> 00:01:35.069
The children silently followed her out.

26
00:01:36.369 --> 00:01:40.270
Walking through the palace, the children noticed many servants.

27
00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:45.292
"There are over nine thousand servants," whispered Helene.

28
00:01:45.312 --> 00:01:48.412
"They do many different jobs."

29
00:01:50.753 --> 00:01:54.074
The children slipped out of the palace through a back door.

30
00:01:55.254 --> 00:01:57.855
Then they went down the steps to the gardens.

31
00:01:58.835 --> 00:02:01.056
The horses from the hunt had returned.

32
00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.161
The dogs were back too.

33
00:02:04.782 --> 00:02:07.224
Important aides rushed over to the king.

34
00:02:08.945 --> 00:02:10.887
The children were pushed to the side.

35
00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:14.670
One gentleman removed the king's jacket.

36
00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.071
Another took his gloves.

37
00:02:17.732 --> 00:02:19.933
King Louis did not look at anyone.

38
00:02:20.994 --> 00:02:23.016
He walked straight into the palace.

39
00:02:23.716 --> 00:02:25.698
His group followed close behind.

40
00:02:25.718 --> 00:02:31.661
"Children!" said a big man wearing a white apron.

41
00:02:31.681 --> 00:02:33.923
"Grab that game.

42
00:02:34.303 --> 00:02:35.244
Bring it to the kitchen!"

43
00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:37.745
He pointed to some dead rabbits.

44
00:02:39.246 --> 00:02:42.268
The animals were tied behind one of the horses.

45
00:02:43.989 --> 00:02:48.031
Helene instantly obeyed, but Mandy stood back.

46
00:02:48.051 --> 00:02:53.134
"Vinnie, I'm going to be sick," she said.

47
00:02:53.154 --> 00:02:56.596
"Just don't look," Vinnie said.

48
00:02:58.228 --> 00:02:59.689
"I have to get away!"

49
00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:01.351
Mandy cried.

50
00:03:01.991 --> 00:03:03.933
She ran back into the palace.

51
00:03:03.953 --> 00:03:07.836
"Mandy!" Vinnie shouted after her.

52
00:03:07.856 --> 00:03:10.438
"Boy! Come in here!"

53
00:03:11.078 --> 00:03:13.761
The big man pulled Vinnie into the kitchen.

54
00:03:16.823 --> 00:03:19.065
Mandy didn't know where she was going.

55
00:03:19.845 --> 00:03:21.947
She ran until she was out of breath.

56
00:03:22.748 --> 00:03:24.749
She found a door slightly open.

57
00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.230
She peeked in.

58
00:03:27.351 --> 00:03:30.734
Inside, a young lady stood before a large mirror.

59
00:03:31.734 --> 00:03:34.295
Mandy counted seven servants in the room.

60
00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:37.657
Each one held a different piece of clothing.

61
00:03:37.677 --> 00:03:41.019
"What is the king wearing?"

62
00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:42.500
the lady asked.

63
00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:46.562
"He is upset," said an older servant.

64
00:03:46.582 --> 00:03:49.504
"He caught only four rabbits.

65
00:03:49.844 --> 00:03:52.025
He will probably be wearing dark blue."

66
00:03:52.045 --> 00:03:56.528
"Then you know what dress to bring," the lady said.

67
00:03:57.628 --> 00:03:59.429
Mandy felt someone poke her.

68
00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.510
It was another servant.

69
00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.912
"What are you doing here?"

70
00:04:04.592 --> 00:04:06.273
the woman whispered sternly.

71
00:04:07.774 --> 00:04:09.535
Mandy quickly moved aside.

72
00:04:10.235 --> 00:04:12.197
The servant knocked and entered the room.

73
00:04:13.617 --> 00:04:19.601
Mandy overheard her saying: "My lady, the king will be changing to white and green."

74
00:04:19.621 --> 00:04:24.944
"Then bring my green gown," the young lady ordered.

75
00:04:26.249 --> 00:04:31.707
Mandy remembered what Helene said: everyone does what the king does.
